name: Extract
description: Pull structured data out of the cell's files as JSON — a one-shot agent pass guided by the
  extract skill. Describe the shape you want in the system prompt.
tags:
- extract
prompt: Run the extract skill over this cell's files and write the structured result to output.json. The
  target schema — its exact key names and nesting — is pinned in the system prompt.
settings:
  agent-config.set_yaml:
    surface: annotation
    session: oneshot
    backend: pydantic-ai
    system_prompt: ''
    mcp: 'off'
    approvals: auto
    selected_file_first: false
folders:
- _skills
accounts: {}
permissions:
  docker: none
  internet: full
  commands: deny
packages: {}
